  "caption_latex": "{Terminal-readout comparison} after unmonitored preparation at $J_b=0.25\\omega_c$. {(a):} Uniform cavity loss: endpoint concurrence $\\mathcal C_{13}$ before the terminal readout and after measuring $Y_2$ and applying $Z_1Z_3$ to the minus branch. {(b):} The same two concurrence estimates for weak-end loss. In both panels dashed curves show the unread endpoint state, solid curves show the corrected mixture, and the black dotted $J_b=0$ control vanishes. Fine dotted curves and pointwise 95\\% bands use the unmonitored HOPS ensembles of main Fig.~1. Each time represents a separately chosen terminal operation; this figure does not include continuous feedback."
